{"title": "Heat Convergence", "pageid": 12268, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heat_Convergence", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Heat_Convergence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Heat_Convergence.webp/300px-Heat_Convergence.webp, /w/images/3/36/Heat_Convergence.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Heat_Convergence.webp/300px-Heat_Convergence.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Heat_Convergence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Heat Convergence</b> is a toggleable passive feature available to entities with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a> condition. It allows them to consume all turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a> to deal extra Fire damage on their next spell or attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Consume your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a> to fuel a powerful attack. \n</p><p>The next time you deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span> damage, you deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage for every turn of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a> remaining.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Heat_Convergence\"> Condition: Heat Convergence </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Convergence_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat Convergence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Convergence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Heat_Convergence_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Convergence_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat Convergence (Condition)\">Heat Convergence</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The next time the affected entity deals Fire damage, it deals an additional 1 for every turn of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a> still affecting them.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a> condition.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Spells that hit multiple times, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/25px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/38px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/50px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scorching Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp/25px-Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Scorching_Ray_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scorching_Ray\" title=\"Scorching Ray\">Scorching Ray</a>, will consume <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a> on the first hit and deal extra damage <b>only</b> on that first hit.</li>\n<li>Area of effect spells, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/25px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/38px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/50px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fireball\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/25px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fireball\" title=\"Fireball\">Fireball</a>, will deal the bonus damage to all affected targets.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200444\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3124/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24633/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10422/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 855175/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   68.968      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   68.968      1 -total\n 48.78%   33.645      6 Template:Cond\n 34.74%   23.961     10 Template:Icon_link\n 33.67%   23.225      1 Template:PageSeo\n 33.41%   23.041     10 Template:Icon_text\n 33.25%   22.935      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.98%   19.296     29 Template:Trim\n 25.44%   17.545      6 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 15.61%   10.766     10 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12268-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200444 and revision id 232294. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}